      "name": "2. Non Functional Requirements"
    },
    {
      "id": "I48vjYxxNtlC9vzxY11pp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1912.4185791015625,
      "y": 181.8255615234375,
      "width": 271.9668884277344,
      "height": 120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "kG1_YEDQuAyDhU_B3EyjF",
      "index": "bVbl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1258260650,
      "version": 718,
      "versionNonce": 2082479647,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770820903807,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Authentication.\n2. Analytics\n3. Profile creation and photo upload\n5. Audit\n6. Payment or Subscription \n7. Friends, Chats and likes",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Authentication.\n2. Analytics\n3. Profile creation and photo upload\n5. Audit\n6. Payment or Subscription \n7. Friends, Chats and likes",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "kG1_YEDQuAyDhU_B3EyjF",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 1901.2679397340803,
      "y": 174.50612749372175,
      "width": 436.24048771933946,
      "height": 141.34119960240028,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bVc",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2012002986,
      "version": 803,
      "versionNonce": 1812961105,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770820903807,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "name": "3. Out of scope"
    },
    {
      "id": "uk9jbqZ0v3jPckoQtu9xx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 930.7546122073195,
      "y": 186.75851440429688,
      "width": 448.1318788537002,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "iHrppBn5G2wo-rIHQ9p89",
      "index": "bVd",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 938581610,
      "version": 2164,
      "versionNonce": 1339359807,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770820903807,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. System should be highly available.\n2. System can accept highly consistency from swipe\nperspective\n3. 20M DAU, ~100 swipes/user/day on average\n4. Low latency while looking at the stack (<300ms)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. System should be highly available.\n2. System can accept highly consistency from swipe perspective\n3. 20M DAU, ~100 swipes/user/day on average\n4. Low latency while looking at the stack (<300ms)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_s9WMBYvZLbymSJd8sAEY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1385.2288208007812,
      "y": 184.1694793701172,
      "width": 463.84667968750006,
      "height": 40.085968017578125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "iHrppBn5G2wo-rIHQ9p89",
      "index": "bVe",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1825727414,
      "version": 2045,
      "versionNonce": 94537009,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770820903807,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. Consider US market from a scope perspective but the system\nshould be scalable.",
      "fontSize": 16.03438720703125,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. Consider US market from a scope perspective but the system should be scalable.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Q1Uz5Pc-USH2LDBY8k8EZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 304.138427734375,
      "y": 179.19448852539062,
      "width": 568.6787640706164,
      "height": 74.54528808593751,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "NOs8gAXnuvVTRFC0UYOcZ",
      "index": "bVh",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 782165162,
      "version": 2073,
      "versionNonce": 2140693087,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770820903807,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. User should be able to create profile with preferrences (age, sex, location etc)\n2. User should be able to see stack of profiles as per the preferences.\n3. User should be able to swipe on the profiles. Right - Like | Left - No\n4. User should be able to see matches or receive notification if there is a match.",
      "fontSize": 14.909057617187504,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. User should be able to create profile with preferrences (age, sex, location etc)\n2. User should be able to see stack of profiles as per the preferences.\n3. User should be able to swipe on the profiles. Right - Like | Left - No\n4. User should be able to see matches or receive notification if there is a match.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "NOs8gAXnuvVTRFC0UYOcZ",
