      "name": "6. Database Selection"
    },
    {
      "id": "vEZI7yqf9IRw_W19QOtZl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 331.33995145836616,
      "y": 1468.8809305826824,
      "width": 1223.5403137207031,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "wQz0Qh2_0J5_Xa7oQdCFf",
      "index": "bVvV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 326985962,
      "version": 3029,
      "versionNonce": 1569982207,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770820903807,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The above design will work but lacks some important features which I will mention in this section.\n1. What is the database choice for profile db and swipe db?\n2. How will you get stacks for a user? Will you compute every time with a SQL query? \n3. How will you notify users for matches found?\n4. How can the system avoid showing user profiles that the user has previously swiped on?\n5. How will you scale to 20M DAU and 2B swipes per day. Whats the database sizing strategy.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The above design will work but lacks some important features which I will mention in this section.\n1. What is the database choice for profile db and swipe db?\n2. How will you get stacks for a user? Will you compute every time with a SQL query? \n3. How will you notify users for matches found?\n4. How can the system avoid showing user profiles that the user has previously swiped on?\n5. How will you scale to 20M DAU and 2B swipes per day. Whats the database sizing strategy.\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
