    {
      "id": "RyKFG73EeWKGJ7Mtfj90C",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1819.8195706106765,
      "y": 949.3191178834554,
      "width": 517.7115478515625,
      "height": 280,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "Noakjn4DaYgg_upnEdp7U",
      "index": "bhqzz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2096209997,
      "version": 518,
      "versionNonce": 1646910641,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770820903807,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. We have added 2 microservices\n    a. Profile Service\n    b. Swipe Service\n\n    As we know we will have more load on the swipe service, it is \n    better to keep it separate as we can scale then independently.\n\n3. We have kept the databases also separate. \n    a. Swipe database - holds the swipes data\n    b. Profile database - Holds the profile data and the match\n                             data\n\n    This will split the load between the databases.\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. We have added 2 microservices\n    a. Profile Service\n    b. Swipe Service\n\n    As we know we will have more load on the swipe service, it is \n    better to keep it separate as we can scale then independently.\n\n3. We have kept the databases also separate. \n    a. Swipe database - holds the swipes data\n    b. Profile database - Holds the profile data and the match\n                             data\n\n    This will split the load between the databases.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
