      "text": "Mobile \nClient",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Mobile \nClient",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "grSOXgbJzVOfxEuIIKLvM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2527.153272517134,
      "y": 2050.9183249350413,
      "width": 578.0465240478517,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "lH6xAEtUNjqmCqP_cnAmU",
      "index": "biC",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 126882247,
      "version": 2845,
      "versionNonce": 993152927,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770820903807,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- When we started with the design we thought Postgress\nwill be a good fit for this use case as it provides strong\nconsistency. But there are 2 very important things we\ndiscovered\n1. The size of the swipes - 200GB per day\n2. 200K requests per second - Write heavy database.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- When we started with the design we thought Postgress\nwill be a good fit for this use case as it provides strong\nconsistency. But there are 2 very important things we discovered\n1. The size of the swipes - 200GB per day\n2. 200K requests per second - Write heavy database.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "SUZ8l5xfdeh3ko3ZDZm_C",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2527.975230430775,
      "y": 2221.9548686408853,
      "width": 581.1991171242053,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "lH6xAEtUNjqmCqP_cnAmU",
      "index": "biCx",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 762141263,
      "version": 149,
      "versionNonce": 59981265,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770820903807,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Question? - Cant PostGres handle it? Ans - Yes it can, but\nwe have to introduce lot of shards and then a very good\narchival process for archiving old data.\nAlso if there is any additional shard, then redistribution of\ndata can be an overhead.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Question? - Cant PostGres handle it? Ans - Yes it can, but\nwe have to introduce lot of shards and then a very good archival process for archiving old data.\nAlso if there is any additional shard, then redistribution of data can be an overhead.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "lH6xAEtUNjqmCqP_cnAmU",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 2513.370425205348,
      "y": 2037.3508649668145,
      "width": 1269.1364467390001,
      "height": 373.56942756618884,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "biD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 324550887,
      "version": 2783,
      "versionNonce": 547685311,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770820903807,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "name": "1. Database choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "BjNCWjulNIpR0da5r0xHZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3146.8709959888174,
      "y": 2055.113518792156,
      "width": 578.0465240478517,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "lH6xAEtUNjqmCqP_cnAmU",
      "index": "biH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1203960903,
      "version": 2648,
      "versionNonce": 1793940401,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770820903807,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Solution - We have other database options - Cassandra\ndb. This is write optimized database and can handle\nmillions of transactions per second.\n- The database is also partitioned for storing the swipes\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Solution - We have other database options - Cassandra db. This is write optimized database and can handle millions of transactions per second.\n- The database is also partitioned for storing the swipes\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "S2YRvw47WwDvFxmysFWse",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 535.0565143488684,
      "y": 363.376615600586,
      "width": 213.64991075538825,
      "height": 109.23439453124996,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "2vH1j8siTfxIYp4TwMYvo",
      "index": "biU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1677452589,
      "version": 2134,
      "versionNonce": 166474719,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770820903807,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. Stacks??\n- At this point we may or may\nnot store the stacks in the\nprimary DB. We will deep dive\ninto this in our detail design\nsection.",
      "fontSize": 14.564585937499997,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. Stacks??\n- At this point we may or may not store the stacks in the primary DB. We will deep dive into this in our detail design section.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
