    {
      "id": "y5jxrPov-K-XdBYfsVz9w",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2400.687951944586,
      "y": 2504.4711173248957,
      "width": 598.6293112036115,
      "height": 320,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "gJ4QBiXQgfUrJP1cV6aLk",
      "index": "biyV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1921919087,
      "version": 300,
      "versionNonce": 781760799,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770820903807,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- We create a table with compond primary key\n\nCREATE TABLE swipes (\n    user_pair text,      -- partition key: smaller_id:larger_id\n    from_user uuid,      -- clustering key\n    to_user uuid,        -- clustering key\n    direction text,\n    created_at timestamp,\n    PRIMARY KEY ((user_pair), from_user, to_user)\n);\n\n- This way - # Sort IDs so (A->B) and (B->A) are in same partition.\n\n- By ensuring all swipes between two users are stored in same partition, we\ncan query matches in same partition. The partition key eleminates cross\npartition operations.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- We create a table with compond primary key\n\nCREATE TABLE swipes (\n    user_pair text,      -- partition key: smaller_id:larger_id\n    from_user uuid,      -- clustering key\n    to_user uuid,        -- clustering key\n    direction text,\n    created_at timestamp,\n    PRIMARY KEY ((user_pair), from_user, to_user)\n);\n\n- This way - # Sort IDs so (A->B) and (B->A) are in same partition.\n\n- By ensuring all swipes between two users are stored in same partition, we can query matches in same partition. The partition key eleminates cross partition operations.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gJ4QBiXQgfUrJP1cV6aLk",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 2381.6327532843466,
      "y": 2489.6952526739124,
      "width": 1269.1364467390001,
      "height": 373.56942756618884,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
