      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- We can introduce Redis to store the recent swipes as a key value\nstructure\n\nKey: \"swipes:123:456\"\nValue: {\n    \"123_swipe\": \"right\", // or yes/no\n    \"456_swipe\": \"left\"   // or yes/no\n}\n\n- This gives us the consistency we need while maintaining low latency due to\nredis in-memory nature.\n\n- The system scales horizontally as we can add more Redis nodes, with\nconsistent hashing ensuring related swipes stay together.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- We can introduce Redis to store the recent swipes as a key value structure\n\nKey: \"swipes:123:456\"\nValue: {\n    \"123_swipe\": \"right\", // or yes/no\n    \"456_swipe\": \"left\"   // or yes/no\n}\n\n- This gives us the consistency we need while maintaining low latency due to redis in-memory nature.\n\n- The system scales horizontally as we can add more Redis nodes, with consistent hashing ensuring related swipes stay together.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ClQXBJbRsKeLh2nMxeSZ_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4384.92158409497,
      "y": 2511.2950626477254,
      "width": 581.1991171242053,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "gvG5egCYnX67nTXJ9Ih1x",
      "index": "bj3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 621544623,
      "version": 869,
      "versionNonce": 1001262097,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770820903807,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Challenges: \n- The main challenge is maintaining Redis cluster.\n\n- We cannot keep data in redis as persistent store. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Challenges: \n- The main challenge is maintaining Redis cluster.\n\n- We cannot keep data in redis as persistent store. ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "I0wIjZ-VQAi9Hlj0dm7bl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4387.605881264185,
      "y": 2639.957808967471,
      "width": 578.0465240478517,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "gvG5egCYnX67nTXJ9Ih1x",
      "index": "bj4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 497391311,
      "version": 3260,
      "versionNonce": 655702399,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770820903807,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Solution:\n\n1. Only maintain recent swipes in Redis\n2. Flush older swipes in Cassandra so that in case Redis\ngoes down, we can rebuild the data.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Solution:\n\n1. Only maintain recent swipes in Redis\n2. Flush older swipes in Cassandra so that in case Redis goes down, we can rebuild the data.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gvG5egCYnX67nTXJ9Ih1x",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 3741.406816103384,
      "y": 2492.164392656935,
      "width": 1269.1364467390001,
      "height": 373.56942756618884,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bj5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 227009775,
      "version": 3036,
