    {
      "id": "flZSjI0nm35pLiB7ED_PL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1628.5100177467561,
      "y": 2902.543779856882,
      "width": 578.0465240478517,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "JqKA0pi1bI33Aoq2u88_j",
      "index": "bjK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1899198849,
      "version": 3260,
      "versionNonce": 1877506353,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770820903807,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Solution: \n\n1. Pre-compute and cache user feeds asynchronously.\nPeriodic background jobs can generate feeds based on\nusers’ preferences and locations, storing them in a cache\nfor instant retrieval when the user opens the app. This\nensures that the feed is readily available without the need\nfor real-time computation. Also we will have TTL on cache\nso that user does not get stale feeds if he changes his\nlocation or preferences.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Solution: \n\n1. Pre-compute and cache user feeds asynchronously. Periodic background jobs can generate feeds based on users’ preferences and locations, storing them in a cache for instant retrieval when the user opens the app. This ensures that the feed is readily available without the need for real-time computation. Also we will have TTL on cache so that user does not get stale feeds if he changes his location or preferences.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
