      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "checks\npast swipes\nto remove swiped \nuser\nfrom stack",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "lQCCr_OKcFM65dXoiX6cq",
      "originalText": "checks\npast swipes\nto remove swiped \nuser\nfrom stack",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pGslHCDAmOBaVIbsW8KHm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2425.4872469673605,
      "y": 3128.4663640934796,
      "width": 598.6293112036115,
      "height": 80,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "AN_pGKSIEOETmhkpvSyaW",
      "index": "bji",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 7112577,
      "version": 585,
      "versionNonce": 2015017425,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770820903807,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- It would be poor user experience if the users were re-shown profiles they\nhad swiped on earlier.\n- It could give the user the impression that thier \"yes\" swipes were not\nrecorded.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- It would be poor user experience if the users were re-shown profiles they\nhad swiped on earlier.\n- It could give the user the impression that thier \"yes\" swipes were not recorded.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "AN_pGKSIEOETmhkpvSyaW",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 2402.439926183308,
      "y": 3113.8232935256165,
      "width": 648.6104453919368,
      "height": 373.56942756618884,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bjl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 164907809,
      "version": 3102,
      "versionNonce": 929253311,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770820903807,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "name": "3.  Avoid showing user profiles which are previously swiped"
    },
    {
      "id": "lDg7bc99FyNLwyaCRDDtv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2428.9388032014535,
      "y": 3224.7437236584246,
      "width": 578.0465240478517,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "AN_pGKSIEOETmhkpvSyaW",
      "index": "bjm",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 936774127,
      "version": 3310,
      "versionNonce": 1495619505,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770820903807,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Solution: We will store the swiped list on the device\ndatastore. So that when we get the stack, we will check\nin the device cache if the id is already swiped or not  and\nthen filter it out.\n\nThe client works as a part of this system because we can\nmake the assumption that the user is only using this app\non one device. Therefore, we can leverage the client as a\nplace to manage and store data.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Solution: We will store the swiped list on the device datastore. So that when we get the stack, we will check in the device cache if the id is already swiped or not  and then filter it out.\n\nThe client works as a part of this system because we can make the assumption that the user is only using this app on one device. Therefore, we can leverage the client as a place to manage and store data.\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
